.TH "YAMLR-STATUS" "1" "March 2026" "Yamlr Manual" "User Commands"
\fBHealth Dashboard\fR
.PP
Displays an SRE-focused dashboard of the current workspace and system health.
.PP
.SH "USAGE"
.nf
.RS
yamlr status [FLAGS]
.RE
.fi
.SH "FLAGS"
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fB--kube-version\fR: Force a specific Kubernetes version (e.g., \fB1.31\fR).
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fB--output=json\fR: Output dashboard as structured JSON.
.SH "OUTPUT"
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **Configuration**: Path to \fB.yamlr.yaml\fR, active rules count.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **Catalog**: Active Kubernetes schema version and path.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **Backups**: Disk usage and file count in \fB.yamlr/backups\fR.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **Scientific HAS**: Health-as-a-Service scores (Lexical, Schema, Semantic).
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **System Vitality Index**: Enterprise-grade trust aggregation (Shield Engine).
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **Onboarding Checklist**: Dynamic status of project setup and completion.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **Authentication**: Current User/Pro identity and license status.
.SH "EXAMPLES"
.nf
.RS
yamlr status
.RE
.fi
